0&h=200&s=2e735e709e3239002e3ece655ae5f3ba, https://si.imgix.net/b08e8c63/uploads/origins/4d523a2e-da0e-4cba-9a39-cf1a740bf578?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=612a81745f42fa139ab413d4785611c1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b08e8c63/uploads/origins/4d523a2e-da0e-4cba-9a39-cf1a740bf578?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=893dbd41c1db5a2bd5941d88bd5c6608 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "邀请纱老师画单人抽抽乐，衣服随便选，根据简介自由发挥就好～\n\n★人物介绍：以培育花草、提取植物以太为工作的炼金术家族后继者梅丽莎，家族被阴谋火灾毁于一旦后得益于已故恩师的守护法术没有进入轮回，而是失去记忆成为幽灵。\n\n在寻找记忆的过程中，不再逃避家族覆灭的事实，即便自己成为幽灵也想继承家族的遗志。经历了敌人想要攫取技术、消灭她灵魂的阻挠，仍旧没有放弃。\n\n复原了炼金工房和庭院，能经由荆棘缠绕的蒸汽风格电梯抵达异世界的秘密实验室，守护以太技术不被用于毁灭世界。同时在外游历修炼，寻求更极致的炼金术。\n\n★供参考的绘制元素：玫瑰花；药剂瓶；庭院；荆棘围绕的电梯；图书馆\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-TA48wFgOKo5wZmlOzZQftS-pb-tufs2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@huasha1116/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7076e06c/uploads/origins/6382cd66-f1ae-4297-a52f-b2fe6dba3083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b68089c18df0c09aeaba05a1afcd3672", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7076e06c/uploads/origins/6382cd66-f1ae-4297-a52f-b2fe6dba3083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b68089c18df0c09aeaba05a1afcd3672, https://si.imgix.net/7076e06c/uploads/origins/6382cd66-f1ae-4297-a52f-b2fe6dba3083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bedad7f6510f600c92f925d9c99e3f61 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7076e06c/uploads/origins/6382cd66-f1ae-4297-a52f-b2fe6dba3083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7196b68c2dd83d2e927e81f55f25de7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "打扰了，想邀请纱锅画一下oc的双人抽抽乐🥺q版或正比都行，如果可以的话请画【蒸朋pa】里的服设，画现代原版的也完全没问题！\n不介意画得像小女孩，欧擦本人也不介意（？）麻烦纱锅了！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10nGIGzQSRspTLNZZl8x0jPGVnzVOlosG", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path